flowchart TD
    TICK["Reconciliation tick<br/>every reconciliation_interval_seconds"] --> READ
    READ["Read current state<br/>allocated VMs · reserved capacity"] --> HR
    HR["Compute headroom<br/>free_slots = reserved − allocated"] --> RATIO
    RATIO["Compute headroom ratio<br/>headroom_ratio = free_slots / reserved"] --> CHECK

    CHECK{"headroom_ratio < threshold<br/>for this CRG type?"}
    CHECK -->|No| LOOP["No action —<br/>wait for next tick"]
    LOOP -.-> TICK

    CHECK -->|Yes| DEBOUNCE{"Debounce check:<br/>last_trigger < now − 30 min<br/>(per region + CRG type)?"}
    DEBOUNCE -->|No — in cooldown| SKIP["Skip — suppress duplicate<br/>within cooldown window"]
    SKIP -.-> TICK
    DEBOUNCE -->|Yes| CREATE["Create CapacityIncreaseRequest<br/>writes OperationRecord →<br/>escalates to quota / capacity subsystem"]
    CREATE --> TICK

    THRESH["Configurable thresholds (PlacementPolicy, remaining-headroom %):<br/>prod_autoincrease_threshold = 0.20<br/>nonprod_autoincrease_threshold = 0.20<br/>dr_autoincrease_threshold = 0.35 (higher — DR is lean bootstrap)"]
    CHECK -.-> THRESH

    FLOOR["Reconciliation floor vs threshold:<br/>Floor = Allocated + Buffer is the minimum the CRG must always reserve.<br/>The threshold is the EARLY-WARNING signal that fires above that floor."]
    RATIO -.-> FLOOR
